{"id":"ink-tmdb-1532610","type":"MOVIE","category":"STREAMING","title":"Ink","overview":"A finales de la década de 1960, en Gran Bretaña, el magnate de los medios de comunicación Rupert Murdoch adquiere el periódico The Sun, que atravesaba dificultades, y se propone cambiar su rumbo editorial y noticioso por completo. Junto al director Larry Lamb, Murdoch reinventa el periódico como un tabloide atrevido y provocador, cambiando el panorama del periodismo británico y sentando las bases de un imperio mediático.","releaseDate":"2027-01-08","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTmfOuLiyylwozRwGnV2rtkR6Qi.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sWtM1GfbjMkcvpj2riGW8QxlTr.jpg","genres":["Drama","Historia"],"originalLanguage":"en","spokenLanguages":["English"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sWtM1GfbjMkcvpj2riGW8QxlTr.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/vGk78yhrv7tjVTaMsDS7tMZQ6yB.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jAEOcxjzESltrJFTJAPNdRYl0N1.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yV5ybC6HHzUYCEogtFzOeUvxRYt.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/32tmsTSplvFYNzvU1xXbVbqGutj.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Jack O'Connell","role":"Larry Lamb","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jiqppSqdmHZ0smiAyd6Iu3P3ZQ.jpg","personTmdbId":85065,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Guy Pearce","role":"Rupert Murdoch","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTqk6Nh3WgqPubkS23eOlMAwmwa.jpg","personTmdbId":529,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Claire Foy","role":"Jules Davies","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pI1lOswQWZRhc8TKu0MESulw9uF.jpg","personTmdbId":120932,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Blake Harrison","role":"Ray Mills","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYLIn1nwicirKMktJYbPOZ7rROy.jpg","personTmdbId":222068,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Patrick Kennedy","role